{"id":"408527","name":"黄瓜木耳虾皮汤","author":"香香的小厨房","authorId":"10121381","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/408527/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"黄瓜","amount":"1根"},{"name":"木耳","amount":"10朵左右"},{"name":"虾皮","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"姜末","amount":"适量"},{"name":"葱","amount":"适量"},{"name":"蒜末","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"黄瓜切滚刀块、姜蒜切末。","img":"images/408527/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"黑木耳温水泡发后洗净。","img":"images/408527/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"虾皮洗净。","img":"images/408527/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"热油锅、炒香姜蒜末。","img":"images/408527/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加入虾皮炒香。","img":"images/408527/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入黑木耳炒几下。","img":"images/408527/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入黄瓜翻炒一会儿。","img":"images/408527/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加入一碗水、烧开后煮2分钟。","img":"images/408527/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"调入适量的盐。","img":"images/408527/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放入葱花即可。","img":"images/408527/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/408527/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/408527/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}